{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0054_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7bbb4221f1fd52b8ae1935c6511674d1f5bb6503851d286c6e02cf9039529b7b", "ja": "ああ、すごくえらいぞ！　でも省エネモードは絶対\n周りにバレるから、早めに元気モードになってくれよ？", "zh": "嗯，很了不起喔！不过省电模式绝对会被旁人发现，\n要快点回到活力模式喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0054_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "8ca400d41bdc4d2c6076ff229ac35122ef365a98f46c6bf89b434b46198945d2", "ja": "それなら大丈夫ってカンジ！\nミキね、この衣装、すっごく好きになっちゃったの。", "zh": "关于这点感觉不用担心！\n美希呀，彻底爱上这套服装了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0054_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "aea84097e885f92d611d4ab994a590d9273e602efc896881a4a7b966d5229047", "ja": "デザインもシルエットも、すっごくカワイイし♪\nだから、いつでもハニー大好きモードになれるんだよ☆", "zh": "设计跟外型都超可爱的♪\n所以无论何时都可以进入最爱HONEY模式喔☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0054_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3ceda850e97bb1db75578097222a2318bc91d16b40f92d5678848b8d0a264273", "ja": "そ、そうか。それも周りにバレないように頼むぞ？", "zh": "是、是吗？那个模式也要拜托你别被旁人发现啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0054_1011_p", "source_sha256": "03fa29b4142054f886218880ddcf02c3183d80ae641ccfc2e367c4c0519a27b5", "ja": "ま、元気になれるならいいんだけど。今日の仕事も、\nその調子で頼むぞ！　それじゃ、現場で会おうな。", "zh": "不过嘛，你能有活力是好事。\n今天的工作也要维持这股热情喔！那就到时候见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0054_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "303c0266cab3bac2e050a5eaccba8748c4c663aefb49711d0cac7ca6e39dc621", "ja": "えっ？　ハニー、ミキと一緒に行かないの？", "zh": "咦？HONEY，你不和美希一起去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
