{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_003mik0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_003mik0054_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "57c12cbd7596e7f94f5cb150a280463365153cb6e35deba29e5215a557e501fd", "ja": "むー、つまんないの。\nミキ、お昼寝しようかな～。あふぅ。", "zh": "唔～真无聊。\n美希来睡午觉好了～啊呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
